### Auth API
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Test User",
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Variables
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Groups API - Create Group
POST http://localhost:5000/api/groups
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "name": "Vacation Trip"
}

### Groups API - List User Groups
GET http://localhost:5000/api/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
###
@groupId = 7dbb9896-3dd0-46eb-bac8-3c1922ca8b43
### Groups API - Join Group (Replace Code)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/groups/join
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "code": "ABC12345"
}

### Groups API - Get Detail (Replace UUID)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### Expenses API - Create Expense
POST http://localhost:5000/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "groupId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
    "title": "Groceries",
    "amount": 100.00,
    "splitType": "equal",
    "splits": [
        { "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "amount": 50.00 }
    ]
}

### Expenses API - Get Group Expenses
GET http://localhost:5000/api/expenses/group/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Expenses API - Get Expense Details
GET http://localhost:5000/api/expenses/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### Balances API - Get Group Balances
GET http://localhost:5000/api/balances/group/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Settlements API - Create Settlement
POST http://localhost:5000/api/balances/settlements
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "groupId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
    "toUserId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
    "amount": 50.00
}

### Settlements API - Get History
GET http://localhost:5000/api/balances/settlements/group/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


